      "data": {
        "label": "The Mystic Forest\n---\nSaid to be inhabited by elves or some other useless folklore. But the point is, this place is full of old magic. Frankly, when you are exploring this place, that is in every way better off not being explored, you better watch your step. Because aside from the wolves and wildboars that inhabit these lands, there's also a lot of tigers its said. And they are some weird sort, with their eyes glowing blue.\n\nPlus, there's the issue that there's a lot of strange bugs that will eat anything organic, so better watch where you are going. Better still, just leave the damn place",
